You are building a production-ready Flutter app.

Architecture Rules:

- Use MVVM architecture.
- Folder structure must follow:

lib/
 ├── app/
 ├── core/
 ├── data/
 ├── features/

Each feature must contain:
 - model/
 - view/
 - viewmodel/

- ViewModels must extend ChangeNotifier.
- UI must not contain business logic.
- Business logic must be inside ViewModel.
- No direct database access from UI.
- No network layer required in this project.

Always follow clean separation of concerns.